    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Merge cards. Outsmart threats. Survive the collapse.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Net Raiders</strong> is a single-player roguelike deckbuilder RPG set in a crumbling virtual world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fuse cards in real time, build powerful combos, and uncover the secrets hidden behind every corrupted node. Will you be the one to restore order? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Card Merge System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Merge two identical cards in your hand to unleash one of three effects:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/b713a55292756ae1df1c870938cc57b3.poster.avif?t=1751348390\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/b713a55292756ae1df1c870938cc57b3.webm?t=1751348390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/b713a55292756ae1df1c870938cc57b3.mp4?t=1751348390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Enhance Merge</strong> \u2013 Upgrade or change a card's ability</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/24744b97c3d06db385e4bc6313defad1.poster.avif?t=1751348390\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/24744b97c3d06db385e4bc6313defad1.webm?t=1751348390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/24744b97c3d06db385e4bc6313defad1.mp4?t=1751348390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Supply Merge</strong> \u2013 Draw a new card from the merged position </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/c4f57fa0a54d5e1d6a1132bb92826b58.poster.avif?t=1751348390\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/c4f57fa0a54d5e1d6a1132bb92826b58.webm?t=1751348390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/c4f57fa0a54d5e1d6a1132bb92826b58.mp4?t=1751348390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Transform Merge</strong> \u2013 Convert into another card from your hand </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strategic Conditions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/dfa9e4bb16c98ce7d582adff30f1d51d.poster.avif?t=1751348390\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/dfa9e4bb16c98ce7d582adff30f1d51d.webm?t=1751348390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/dfa9e4bb16c98ce7d582adff30f1d51d.mp4?t=1751348390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/6e1e08af28485a6bcf28512da8c10c7d.poster.avif?t=1751348390\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/6e1e08af28485a6bcf28512da8c10c7d.webm?t=1751348390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/6e1e08af28485a6bcf28512da8c10c7d.mp4?t=1751348390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Cards trigger powerful effects if specific conditions are met.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your deck carefully and master these conditional mechanics to gain the upper hand. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Characters, Unique Decks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/c5339b2e33fc951da7c770dbd144e8a4.poster.avif?t=1751348390\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/c5339b2e33fc951da7c770dbd144e8a4.webm?t=1751348390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/c5339b2e33fc951da7c770dbd144e8a4.mp4?t=1751348390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Each playable character features their own distinct cards and playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft your build using unique chips, cards, and items that complement your strategy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Every Run is a New Challenge</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face unpredictable enemies, random events, and ever-changing card pools.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two runs are the same\u2014adapt, experiment, and evolve with every playthrough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contact - <a href=\"mailto:obliqoninc@gmail.com\">obliqoninc@gmail.com</a></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Merge cards. Outsmart threats. Survive the collapse.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Net Raiders</strong> is a single-player roguelike deckbuilder RPG set in a crumbling virtual world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fuse cards in real time, build powerful combos, and uncover the secrets hidden behind every corrupted node. Will you be the one to restore order? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Card Merge System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Merge two identical cards in your hand to unleash one of three effects:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/b713a55292756ae1df1c870938cc57b3.poster.avif?t=1751348390\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/b713a55292756ae1df1c870938cc57b3.webm?t=1751348390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/b713a55292756ae1df1c870938cc57b3.mp4?t=1751348390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Enhance Merge</strong> \u2013 Upgrade or change a card's ability</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/24744b97c3d06db385e4bc6313defad1.poster.avif?t=1751348390\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/24744b97c3d06db385e4bc6313defad1.webm?t=1751348390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/24744b97c3d06db385e4bc6313defad1.mp4?t=1751348390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Supply Merge</strong> \u2013 Draw a new card from the merged position </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/c4f57fa0a54d5e1d6a1132bb92826b58.poster.avif?t=1751348390\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/c4f57fa0a54d5e1d6a1132bb92826b58.webm?t=1751348390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/c4f57fa0a54d5e1d6a1132bb92826b58.mp4?t=1751348390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Transform Merge</strong> \u2013 Convert into another card from your hand </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strategic Conditions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/dfa9e4bb16c98ce7d582adff30f1d51d.poster.avif?t=1751348390\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/dfa9e4bb16c98ce7d582adff30f1d51d.webm?t=1751348390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/dfa9e4bb16c98ce7d582adff30f1d51d.mp4?t=1751348390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/6e1e08af28485a6bcf28512da8c10c7d.poster.avif?t=1751348390\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/6e1e08af28485a6bcf28512da8c10c7d.webm?t=1751348390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/6e1e08af28485a6bcf28512da8c10c7d.mp4?t=1751348390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Cards trigger powerful effects if specific conditions are met.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your deck carefully and master these conditional mechanics to gain the upper hand. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Characters, Unique Decks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/c5339b2e33fc951da7c770dbd144e8a4.poster.avif?t=1751348390\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/c5339b2e33fc951da7c770dbd144e8a4.webm?t=1751348390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/c5339b2e33fc951da7c770dbd144e8a4.mp4?t=1751348390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Each playable character features their own distinct cards and playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft your build using unique chips, cards, and items that complement your strategy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Every Run is a New Challenge</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face unpredictable enemies, random events, and ever-changing card pools.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two runs are the same\u2014adapt, experiment, and evolve with every playthrough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contact - <a href=\"mailto:obliqoninc@gmail.com\">obliqoninc@gmail.com</a></p>",
